message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: Cairn
abstract: >-
  A model-agnostic detection-and-analysis engine built to become a decentralized,
  distributed network in which volunteers lend their own AI to collectively notice
  harm and route it to the institutions that can act. That decentralized,
  volunteer-powered network is the target; today the engine runs as a
  single-operator, offline pilot, with the distributed deployment a deliberately
  deferred, independently-reviewed phase. Mission-neutral; runs many causes on one
  protocol, with cross-model verification, human-in-the-loop vetting, and a
  tamper-evident transparency log.
